      "summary": "Model self-review (not independent or human review): verified that bare list reuses the validated/ranked autocomplete discovery path, is capped at 25 rendered initiatives and 92 visible columns, reports focus/status/revision/progress/current-or-next work, and does not mutate focus. Topic-specific list retains the existing docket and focus behavior. Help, autocomplete metadata, command description, README, and regression tests agree on the optional topic. During review, corrected help visibility and width handling; no blocking findings remain.",
